{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758080/extras/Main-GIF-Final.gif?t=1748419345\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Night Swarm demo, witness young apprentice Roderic\u2019s first trial against the darkness. With 5 different companions, 3 unique NPCs, and dozens of quests, this experience marks your first step toward becoming a true Vampire Lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758080/extras/Fights-GIF-Final.gif?t=1748419345\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Roderic as he earns loyalty, defeats his first enemies, and strives to rule the night. Each quest shapes the fate not only of him, but also those who fight by his side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just a demo \u2014 but the night is long, and you're still hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758080/extras/Tame-GIF-Final.gif?t=1748419345\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your legend spread faster than your shadow; become a beacon of hope for those still resisting the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They await a new Vampire Lord worthy of the night. That leader is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw them to your side. Teach them how to fight. And remind the world that the true horror of the night... is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758080?t=1748419345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758080/66e27fb4bd4aa668f55b671682fe685d7efce96d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748419345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste